@startuml 06_seq_account_erase
title DSGVO account erase via the personal-data registry (FR-60, security §10)

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Recruiter
participant "AccountController" as Ctrl
participant "AccountService" as Svc
participant "UserErasureStep[]\n(registered in container.ts)" as Reg
participant "each container\n(keys, sessions, reset-,\nverification-tokens, usage)" as Stores
participant "UserRepository" as Users

Recruiter -> Ctrl : DELETE /account
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc : erase(userId)
activate Svc

loop for each registered erasure step
  Svc -> Reg : step.erase(userId)
  Reg -> Stores : destroyForUser / removeForUser
  Stores --> Reg : done (idempotent)
end
note right of Reg : the list lives once, in the composition root.\nemail-verification tokens are a registered step —\nthe leak where erase forgot them cannot recur.

Svc -> Users : remove(userId)
note right of Users : account row removed **last** —\nit is the identity the rest hangs off
Users --> Svc : done
Svc --> Ctrl : void
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> Recruiter : 204 + clear session cookie
deactivate Ctrl

note over Svc : team-owned data (mandates, talents, …) is left —\none member leaving cannot wipe the team's work

@enduml
